    "prose": "use client\nRating\nScores, reviews, and quality signals\nA radio group of stars: arrow keys move the selection, hover previews it, and a read-only mode renders the same row as a static score. The icon and scale length are configurable.\nDefault\nRate this component\nEmpty rating\nSizes\nDefault size\nCompact size\nRead only\nAverage rating\nCustom scale and icon\nScore out of ten\nFavourite level\nStates\nClearable: select the current star again to clear\nDisabled rating\nThumbs\nWas this page helpful?\nA two-way verdict for a quick \"Was this helpful?\". Value 1 is up and 2 is down, with the same keys as the stars."
